# My-IDM — Download Manager

## One URL per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
## Supports HTTP/HTTPS URLs and magnet links.

# Example HTTP downloads:
# https://example.com/file.zip
# https://releases.ubuntu.com/24.04/ubuntu-24.04-desktop-amd64.iso

# Example magnet links:
# magnet:?xt=urn:btih:EXAMPLE_HASH&dn=example_file

# Example .torrent file paths:
# D:\Torrents\example.torrent
